WEBVTT - KCSP WhatsApp Security Awareness Platform Pitch Subtitles

00:00.500 --> 00:06.000
For years, enterprises have poured millions into securing corporate email.

00:06.200 --> 00:11.500
Firewalls, secure email gateways, and endless phishing drills.

00:11.800 --> 00:15.200
But cybercriminals have evolved.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.500
Today, the most dangerous attacks bypass corporate inboxes entirely,

00:21.700 --> 00:27.800
landing directly on employees' personal and work smartphones via WhatsApp.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.800
With open rates exceeding 98% and response times under 3 minutes,

00:33.000 --> 00:37.200
mobile messaging has become the enterprise's greatest blind spot.

00:37.800 --> 00:41.200
Meet KCSP: the enterprise-grade WhatsApp

00:41.400 --> 00:45.500
Security Awareness Simulation Platform.

00:45.800 --> 00:50.000
KCSP empowers security teams to run realistic, controlled mobile simulations,

00:50.300 --> 00:54.800
safely train employees at the exact moment of risk,

00:54.000 --> 00:59.800
and measure organizational human resilience in real time.

01:00.200 --> 01:04.800
It starts with our modular, provider-independent architecture.

01:05.000 --> 01:09.500
Test instantly with zero cost using our local Mock Provider,

01:09.800 --> 01:15.200
or scale with production gateways like WASender API and self-hosted WPPConnect.

01:15.600 --> 01:20.000
Security officers create targeted campaigns across departments,

01:20.200 --> 01:24.500
dispatched through an asynchronous queue with built-in rate limiting

01:24.700 --> 01:28.800
and anti-spam jitter protection.

01:29.200 --> 01:34.200
Each participant receives a unique 32-byte opaque tracking link

01:34.400 --> 01:38.000
with zero personal data exposed.

01:38.400 --> 01:43.000
When they open the high-fidelity Microsoft 365 or HR simulation page,

01:43.200 --> 01:47.500
KCSP's Zero-Credential Engine immediately intercepts the form.

01:47.800 --> 01:53.000
Passwords and sensitive secrets are strictly discarded right in the browser.

01:53.400 --> 01:57.800
Instead of shaming, the screen transforms into an educational debrief,

01:58.000 --> 02:02.500
highlighting the three red flags they missed.

02:03.000 --> 02:07.500
In the Admin Console, CISOs access live telemetry:

02:07.700 --> 02:12.000
delivery rates, unique clicks, and department vulnerability heatmaps,

02:12.200 --> 02:16.800
backed by HMAC SHA-256 hashing and GDPR one-click anonymization.

02:17.200 --> 02:22.000
Deployable anywhere in minutes with Docker and Caddy HTTPS.

02:22.400 --> 02:27.500
Close your mobile perimeter. Strengthen your human firewall with KCSP.
